**/caddy
# The frankenphp binary `octane:install` downloads for local development — 161 MB of a thing the
# runtime image already contains.
frankenphp

# NOT ignored: public/frankenphp-worker.php. `octane:install` adds it to .gitignore as generated
# output, and for a repo deployed from a developer's machine that is fine. This image is built from
# a clean checkout, so an untracked file simply does not exist at build time — the image build failed
# on exactly that, and the laptop passed because the file was sitting there untracked. It is seven
# stable lines that decide how the application boots, so it is source, and it is committed.

# Wire contracts, fetched by bin/sync-contracts at a pinned commit. Never committed.
/.contracts/
